###

### 3. Create Collectivity (A) - New collectivity (no name/number yet)
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "location": "Fianarantsoa",
    "speciality": "Maraichage",
    "federationApproval": true,
    "members": ["C2-M1", "C2-M2", "C2-M3", "C2-M4", "C2-M5", "C2-M6", "C2-M7", "C2-M8", "C1-M1", "C1-M2"],
    "structure": {
      "president": "C2-M5",
      "vicePresident": "C2-M6",
      "treasurer": "C2-M8",
      "secretary": "C2-M7"
    }
  }
]

###

### 4. Update collectivity name and number (J) - Use response ID from step 3
PUT http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-2/informations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dobo voalohany",
  "number": "2"
}

### 5. Retrieve collectivity membershipFees (C)
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/membershipFees
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Create membershipFees (C)
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/membershipFees
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "eligibleFrom": "2026-06-22",
    "frequency": "ANNUALLY",
    "amount": 100000.0,
    "label": "Cotisation annuelle"
  }
]

### 7. Get financial accounts current balance (D)
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/financialAccounts
Content-Type: application/json


### 8. Get financial accounts at specific date (D) (tsy mande)
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/financialAccounts?at=2026-05-07T10:00:00Z
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Get collectivity by id (D)
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Get collectivity transactions (D)
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-05-07
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Register member payments (C)
POST http://localhost:8080/members/C1-M1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "amount": 50000,
    "membershipFeeIdentifier": "cot-1",
    "accountCreditedIdentifier": "C1-A-CASH",
    "paymentMode": "CASH"
  }
]

### 12. Get collectivity statistics - partial (G)
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/statistics?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-05-07
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Get federation statistics - partial (H)
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/statistics?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-05-07
Content-Type: application/json

### Bonus 1 : Activities (E & F)
### 14. Create activities for collectivity
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Assemblee generale mensuelle",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "executiveDate": "2026-05-10",
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 2,
      "dayOfWeek": "SU"
    }
  },
  {
    "label": "Formation obligatoire juniors",
    "activityType": "TRAINING",
    "executiveDate": "2026-05-24",
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 4,
      "dayOfWeek": "SA"
    }
  }
]

### 15. Get activities for collectivity
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

### 16. Record attendance for activity (use activity ID from step 14)
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities/act-1778131665778/attendance
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"memberIdentifier": "C1-M1", "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"},
  {"memberIdentifier": "C1-M2", "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"},
  {"memberIdentifier": "C1-M3", "attendanceStatus": "MISSING"},
  {"memberIdentifier": "C1-M4", "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"},
  {"memberIdentifier": "C1-M5", "attendanceStatus": "ATTENDED"}
]

### 17. Get attendance for activity
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities/act-/attendance
Content-Type: application/json

### Bonus 2 : Adjusted statistics (G & H complete)
### 18. Get collectivity statistics with attendance rate
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/statistics?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-05-07
Content-Type: application/json

### 19. Get federation statistics with global attendance rate
GET http://localhost:8080/collectivities/statistics?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-05-07
Content-Type: application/json
